package io.openhoyi.mobile

/** App-tool adaptation of docs/curve-import/photo-to-json.zh-CN.txt, not a default recipe. */
internal object AiHoyiCurveGuidance {
    const val SCREENSHOT = """Official HOYI screenshot transcription: use schema=3, never schema 1/2 that loses flags/times. Checklist: name, temperature, global mode/logic, active stage count, each target/unit/water, first-stage pressure/flow mode, water ceiling, weight target, compensation/sign, preinfusion wait and first-stage time limit. Schematic lines are setpoints, not measured timelines: infer no linear pressure ramp, stage duration or actual flow from them. Copy visible settings, do not tune or optimize unless asked. Missing, cropped or ambiguous fields require a question only for the missing items BEFORE proposing; unseen never means false/0. Read labels, units and selected option, not switch color/position or graph shape. 变压=pressure, variableFlowLogic=false, firstSegmentFlowMode=false; 恒压=pressureLogic false, 跟随=true (a selected logic, not an unknown switch). All targets are bar. 变流=flow, variableFlowLogic=true; 慢速/Ls=pressureLogic false, 快速/Hs=true. In flow mode firstSegmentFlowMode is false for first-stage bar, true for first-stage mL/s; later stages are mL/s. 闷蒸时间=preinfusionSeconds (wait); seconds beside first-stage water=firstDurationSeconds (first-stage time limit), NOT a generic duration on each stage or a measured shot time. 总流量=totalWaterLimitMl (independent water ceiling, not an unconditional hard stop in every stage, not inferred stage sum); 总液重=targetHundredthsGram, 克重补偿=compensationHundredthsGram with sign. Explicit zero weight disables weight target, not water stopping; last-stage water is not an independent hard stop. Convert target bar or mL/s ×10, stage mL ×10, weight/compensation g ×100; total mL, seconds and temperature stay unscaled. Keep 2–4 active stages in order; for a NEW screenshot transcription use 4-active zero inactive slots, never zero missing active fields. For saved edits/copies preserve the complete source including inactive slots. Do not guess a same-name local/factory identity or machine-only origin from a failed local lookup. If units/ranges are unsupported or validation fails, report original values and ask; never clamp, silently round, add/drop active stages or simplify the recipe. No raw import id/UUID in this tool. Follow the strict proposal schema below."""
}
